T("Off: the 3D image renders at the window's resolution. AMD FSR 1: it renders smaller (the mode below), then FSR 1's edge-aware upscaling and sharpening bring it to the window. The HUD and menus always render at the window's resolution.", "關：3D畫面以視窗的解析度算繪。AMD FSR 1：以較小的解析度算繪（下方的模式），再由FSR 1考慮邊緣的放大和銳化放大到視窗大小。畫面顯示和選單始終以視窗的解析度算繪。")
