T("AMD FidelityFX CAS sharpens the 3D image after the upscaler (or at the window's resolution with the upscaler off), before the HUD is drawn over it: edges get crisper without halos. Most useful with AMD FSR 1.", "AMD FidelityFX CAS在放大之後（關閉放大時以視窗的解析度）、在畫面顯示繪製到上面之前銳化3D畫面：邊緣更清晰且沒有光暈。與AMD FSR 1搭配最有用。")
