T("Automatic: while Windows HDR is on for this display, the picture is sent in HDR, so it looks as bright and colourful as in SDR (in SDR, Windows shows it dim and dull then). On: always in HDR, where the display takes it. Off: always SDR. White follows Windows' SDR content brightness (Settings > System > Display > HDR).", "自動：此顯示器開啟 Windows HDR 時，畫面以 HDR 輸出，看起來與 SDR 一樣明亮鮮豔（若為 SDR，Windows 會顯示得暗淡發灰）。開：只要顯示器支援，始終 HDR。關：始終 SDR。白色亮度跟隨 Windows 的 SDR 內容亮度（設定 > 系統 > 螢幕 > HDR）。")
