T("AMD FSR 3: it renders smaller and builds the full-resolution image from the frames before, following the game's motion: sharper and steadier than FSR 1, and anti-aliased (Anti-aliasing has no effect with it). Sharpening sets its own sharpening. NVIDIA DLSS (NVIDIA RTX graphics cards) is coming in a later version.", "AMD FSR 3：以較小的解析度算繪，並跟隨遊戲的動作，用之前的影格建構完整解析度的畫面：比FSR 1更清晰、更穩定，並帶有反鋸齒（反鋸齒設定對其無效）。銳化設定調節它自己的銳化。NVIDIA DLSS（NVIDIA RTX顯示卡）將在之後的版本中推出。")
T("TAA: blends each frame with the ones before it, following the game's motion, so edges stay smooth and stop shimmering; slightly softer, use it with Sharpening.", "TAA：跟隨遊戲的動作，將每個影格與之前的影格混合，使邊緣平滑、不再閃爍；畫面略微柔和，建議搭配銳化使用。")
